0..74 Comment "//! `every-name-answers` writes each kind of name that the editor answers."
75..78 Comment "//!"
79..153 Comment "//! A reader asks the editor where the source declares a name and what the"
154..232 Comment "//! name is. A name that answers nothing leaves the reader to search the text."
233..236 Comment "//!"
237..313 Comment "//! A family, its constructors, a function, its parameter and a `let` binder"
314..389 Comment "//! each answer a definition request at each use. The type table names each"
390..467 Comment "//! binder at its declaration. Rename and references find each binder through"
468..482 Comment "//! that name."
483..486 Comment "//!"
487..563 Comment "//! Limits: no source declares the builtin `Type`. The coverage sweep of the"
564..622 Comment "//! language server keys it as the one gap of this source."
623..626 Comment "//!"
627..677 Comment "//! - see: crates/surface-lsp-core/coverage.ledger"
